<title>UK: LIFFE coffee battles $1,500, cocoa falls further.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee battles $1,500, cocoa falls further.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Continues decline with benchmark Sept battling with $1,500 support. Down $34 at $1,513 at 1009 GMT after a low at $1,501.</p>
<p>COCOA -  Pushes lower in thin volume after Monday's big sell-off. Sept down nine stg at 976 stg but off 974 low.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Holds slim gains in sluggish start. Oct up 80 cents at $325.50.</p>
</text>
